<title>FRANCE: Aerospatiale buys Sextant business.</title>
<headline>Aerospatiale buys Sextant business.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aerospatiale said on Monday it had bought the automatic test activities of Sextant Avionique which it will combine with its similar activities to create a division with 500 million francs in sales.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that the enlarged business would target both military and civilian business.</p>
<p>Aerospatiale also said it had been given the green light by a Nanterre court to acquire the activities of troubled simulator specialist Giravions Dorand Industries (GDI), which has annual sales of 90 million francs.</p>
</text>
